+# F2 Data Plane — Task List (migration pack #1, re-scoped)
+
+Design: [plan.md](plan.md) · Branch: `feat/f2-data-plane` · Issue: `product-suite-5q8`
+
+Waves run sequentially; tasks in the same wave touch disjoint files. Gate commands: `bun run check:migration-parity`, `bun run --cwd packages/db test`, `bun run verify:platform-api`, `bun run test:repo-tooling`.
+
+Baseline (worktree, 2026-09-11): db tests 45/45 green; parity green. Pre-existing Windows-only flakes to ignore unless they worsen: `apps/platform-api/test/db-contract/branch-lease.test.ts` (temp-dir cleanup ENOTEMPTY) and `test/branch-protection.test.js` (2 shim timeouts).
+
+---
+
+## Wave 1 — Contracts
+
+### Task 1: Contract vocabulary for the pack
+
+File(s): `packages/contracts/src/enums.js`, `packages/contracts/contracts/enums.json`, `packages/contracts/src/work-items.js`, `packages/contracts/contracts/work-items-core.json`, `packages/contracts/src/index.d.ts`, `packages/contracts/src/enums.test.ts`, `packages/contracts/src/work-items.test.ts`
+
+What to implement: add `ITEM_VISIBILITY_VALUES = ["org", "restricted"]` and `CONNECTION_SCOPE_VALUES = ["user", "workspace"]`; mirror both in `enums.json`. In the work-items core: `Check.work_item_id` becomes nullable and `Check.project_id` (nullable string) is added; `Project.playbook_ref` (nullable string) added; `visibility` added to `WORK_ITEM_PATCH_FIELDS`; new objects `Playbook` (id, kind, name, phases, timestamps), `ProjectTeam` (id, project_id, team_id, timestamps), `Connection` (id, owner_user_id, scope, server_ref, label, created_at, updated_at — never the credential value). Update `index.d.ts` interfaces and the JSON mirrors to match exactly; the drift-guard tests assert JS/JSON/.d.ts equality.
+
+TDD steps:
+1. Write test: extend `enums.test.ts` (new value sets mirrored) and `work-items.test.ts` (new objects included in the field-set equality table; `Check.work_item_id` nullable, `Check.project_id` present; `visibility` in patch fields).
+2. Run test: `bun run test:contracts` — confirm RED on the new assertions.
+3. Implement: the JS constants, JSON mirrors, and `.d.ts` interfaces.
+4. Run test: `bun run test:contracts` — GREEN.
+5. Commit: `feat(contracts): item visibility, playbook, project-team, connection, check parent`
+
+OWNS: `packages/contracts/src/enums.js`, `packages/contracts/contracts/enums.json`, `packages/contracts/src/work-items.js`, `packages/contracts/contracts/work-items-core.json`, `packages/contracts/src/index.d.ts`, `packages/contracts/src/enums.test.ts`, `packages/contracts/src/work-items.test.ts`
+
+Expected output: `test:contracts` green; `work-items-core.json` mirrors the `.d.ts` field sets exactly.
+
+---
+
+## Wave 2 — Schema
+
+### Task 2: Schema.ts for the pack
+
+File(s): `packages/db/src/schema.ts`, `packages/db/src/schema.test.ts`
+
+What to implement: enums `itemVisibilityEnum('item_visibility', ['org','restricted'])`, `connectionScopeEnum('connection_scope', ['user','workspace'])`; tables `projectTeams` (`tenant_id`, `project_id` FK cascade, `team_id` FK cascade, unique `(project_id, team_id)`, tenant index, timestamps), `connections` (`tenant_id`, `owner_user_id`, `scope` default `user`, `server_ref`, `label`, `credentials_encrypted`, provenance + timestamps, tenant index), `visibilityGrants` (`tenant_id`, `object_type` with CHECK in `('work_item','check')`, `object_id`, `user_id`, unique `(object_type, object_id, user_id)`), `playbooks` (`tenant_id`, `kind`, `name`, `phases` jsonb default `{}`, provenance + timestamps, unique `(tenant_id, kind)`); `checks.workItemId` loses `.notNull()`, gains `projectId` FK cascade + check constraint `num_nonnulls(work_item_id, project_id) <= 1` + project index; `proposals` gains `sourceType`, `sourceId`, `sourceCandidateId`, `targetKind` (all text nullable) + partial unique index on `(tenant_id, source_type, source_id, source_candidate_id, target_kind)` where `source_candidate_id is not null`; `workItems` and `checks` gain `visibility` default `org`; `projects` gains `playbookRef` uuid FK set-null.
+
+TDD steps:
+1. Write test: extend `schema.test.ts` — new enums' `enumValues`, new tables' column sets and unique indexes via `getTableConfig`, `checks.work_item_id` nullable + `project_id` present, `proposals` new columns, `visibility` defaults.
+2. Run test: `bun run --cwd packages/db test` — RED.
+3. Implement: `schema.ts` changes only.
+4. Run test: `bun run --cwd packages/db test` — GREEN.
+5. Commit: `feat(db): schema for project teams, check parents, visibility, playbooks, connections`
+
+OWNS: `packages/db/src/schema.ts`, `packages/db/src/schema.test.ts`
+
+Expected output: db package tests green; schema metadata matches the contract vocabulary.
+
+---
+
+## Wave 3 — Migration
+
+### Task 3: Migration 0022, journal entry, snapshot, SQL assertions
+
+File(s): `packages/db/migrations/0022_f2_data_plane.sql`, `packages/db/migrations/meta/_journal.json`, `packages/db/migrations/meta/0022_snapshot.json`, `packages/db/src/schema.test.ts`
