+
+TDD steps:
+1. Write test: SQL-content assertions added; run `bun run check:migration-parity` with the `.sql` present but no journal entry — confirm RED (orphan SQL file).
+2. Implement: snapshot generation + SQL + journal entry.
+3. Run test: `bun run check:migration-parity` — GREEN; `bun run --cwd packages/db test` — GREEN.
